@@ -9297,3 +9297,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE D1 (ORACLE-DISTINCT ACCURACY complementary measurement; 2026-06-14 P0 MANDATORY) -- the verifier-as-DETECTOR measurement. The standing P0 directive: HEADLINE = an oracle-distinct learned/energy verifier (the in-generation moat, Phase C); COMPLEMENTARY = the verifier-as-DETECTOR measurement (cheap; cached data) -- detection AUROC where SELECTION headroom is ~0. This is the cheap, infra-INDEPENDENT probe of the oracle-distinct ACCURACY frontier that is NOT hostage to the DiffusionGemma infra (which has blocked 3x), diversifying the 'verifier earns its place' bet across THREE vehicles (efficiency/Phase A, in-generation/Phase C, detection/here). Per the spec (docs/research-notes/verifier-as-detector-measurement-spec.md): measure whether the verifier ensemble DETECTS step-errors (AUROC) on corpora where it cannot SELECT a better answer (oracle@K == vote@1, ~0 selection headroom). Emit detector_auroc BARE float + detector_beats_chance BARE bool (AUROC CI95 lower bound > 0.5). verifier_is_oracle=false (a learned/energy detection signal, oracle-distinct). Cached candidates, no live LLM. If a prior detector measurement exists, EXTEND it to a NEW corpus/condition (no churn). NO TRM training. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: detector_beats_chance_zero_selection_headroom_fover; results/experiment_4375_verifier_as_detector_measurement.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .404 bleeding-edge forks (LLM-generated action-cost heuristics / classical planning with code heuristics; E3 executable-world-model deeper ARC solves; verifier-guided diffusion-LM search with scorer-independent local-coherence controls; verifier-as-detector measurement) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .405 roadmap, conditioned on the .404 outcomes (did the stronger LLM-heuristic class deepen the efficiency moat? did E3 reach deeper/tail levels? did the DiffusionGemma scorer-repair convert or RETIRE? did the detector beat chance?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real, VERIFIED arXiv ID/URL (no citation = fabrication). FLAG A2D2 (2606.13565) + SEPO (2502.01384) verifier-as-reward GENERATOR-training as OUT-OF-BAND/operator-owned (NOT auto-run in-loop). Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v405 (the single strongest method for the .405 planner). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v405_mapped; results/experiment_4376_sota_ingestion_v405.json
 - 2026-06-18: PHASE E2 (INFRA/HYGIENE) -- registry/gaps hygiene + GAP-4 regression guard. (1) Reconcile ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md + ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml with the .404 outcomes (the LLM-heuristic efficiency-moat result exp4370/4371; new ARC reproduced levels from exp4372-4373; the DiffusionGemma repair-or-retire result exp4374; the verifier-as-detector result exp4375; any new missing-verifier gaps logged). (2) Run the GAP-4 regression guard (the ARC oracle-distinct verifier-beats-vote result must not silently regress). (3) Verify the capstone verifier_is_oracle stamping fix is STILL durable (the .402 exp4355 fix made the .402/.403 capstones scan 0 flags; confirm the .404 capstone path inherits it). NO production verifier edits (audit-only per Verifier Authenticity Discipline). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_arc_reconciled_to_v404_truth_gap4_guard_passed_True_capstone_stamp_fix_durable_True; results/experiment_4377_registry_gaps_hygiene_gap4_guard.json
+- 2026-06-18: PHASE E3 (HARDWARE CONTINUITY; KV260 opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 SSH-reachability + loaded-bitstream continuity check. Per north-star §3, KV260 is THE sovereignty story (drive to terminal, then freeze); GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic-only. SSH-reachability precondition ONLY (NEVER a host SD-card precondition per KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline). If the board is reachable, record the loaded overlay (xmutil listapps) + a lightweight liveness check (the carnot_ising bitstream UIO device present); if it is the terminal board-latency transcript, capture it. If unreachable -> honest_verdict blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable (a clean documented skip, NOT a fabrication). This keeps the board visible in the milestone retro without burning a deep task slot. NO host SD-card-device precondition (the retired mechanism). NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_kv260_continuity_terminal_reached; results/experiment_4378_hardware_continuity_kv260.json
